%% 帕鲁服务器管理器 · 增量设计时序图
%% 架构师 高见远 · 2026-07-22
%% 覆盖：启动检测 → 双模式判定 → 起服 → 轮询 → 玩家管理 → 优雅关服

sequenceDiagram
    actor U as 用户
    participant App as App.vue
    participant SetS as SettingsStore
    participant SS as ServerStore
    participant UIS as UiStore
    participant RP as RestProxy(Rust)
    participant SRV as Server(Rust)
    participant STEAM as SteamDetect(Rust)
    participant REST as PalServer REST:8212

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ① App 启动 → 双模式判定 ═══

    App->>SetS: initDetectSettings()
    SetS->>SetS: load() → 读 settings.json
    alt server_path 为空
        SetS->>STEAM: api.steam.detect()
        STEAM->>STEAM: 读注册表 + VDF 探测
        STEAM-->>SetS: ["E:\\SteamLibrary\\...\\PalServer"]
        SetS->>SetS: update({server_path}) + save()
    end

    App->>SS: init() → api.server.init()
    SS->>SRV: init_server_state()
    SRV-->>SS: ServerStatus {running, pid, server_path}
    App->>SS: setupLogListener() + setupStatusChangeListener()
    App->>SS: configStore.loadDescriptions()
    App->>SS: networkStore.checkAll()

    alt status.running = true
        App->>UIS: setMode('dashboard')
        App->>SS: startPolling()
        Note over App: 进入仪表盘模式
    else status.running = false
        App->>UIS: setMode('wizard')
        Note over App: 进入向导模式
    end

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ② 向导模式 → 启动服务器 ═══

    U->>App: 点击「自动探测 PalServer.exe」
    App->>STEAM: api.steam.detect()
    STEAM-->>App: ["E:\\SteamLibrary\\...\\PalServer"]
    App->>UIS: finishDetect(path)
    Note over App: Step 1 完成 → 解锁 Step 2

    App->>App: networkStore.checkAll() → 显示端口/Radmin 状态
    Note over App: Step 2: 端口放行态 + Radmin 状态

    U->>App: 点击「启动服务器」
    App->>SS: start(server_path)
    SS->>SRV: start_server(path)
    SRV->>SRV: Command::spawn(PalServer.exe)
    SRV-->>SS: ServerStatus {running: true, pid: xxx}
    App->>UIS: setMode('dashboard')
    App->>SS: startPolling()

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ③ 60s 轮询引擎 ═══

    SS->>SS: pollOnce() (立即执行第一次)
    par 并行请求
        SS->>RP: rest_get_info(server_path)
        RP->>RP: 读 ini → 提取 AdminPassword + RESTAPIPort
        RP->>REST: GET /v1/api/info (Basic Auth admin:pwd)
        REST-->>RP: {version, servername, description, worldguid}
        RP-->>SS: ServerInfo
    and
        SS->>RP: rest_get_metrics(server_path)
        RP->>REST: GET /v1/api/metrics
        REST-->>RP: {serverfps, currentplayernum, days, uptime, ...}
        RP-->>SS: ServerMetrics
    and
        SS->>RP: rest_get_players(server_path)
        RP->>REST: GET /v1/api/players
        REST-->>RP: {players: [{name, userId, level, ping, ...}]}
        RP-->>SS: PlayerInfo[]
    end
    Note over App: 仪表盘显示 服名/FPS/在线人数/玩家表

    loop 每 60 秒
        SS->>SS: pollOnce() → Promise.all([getInfo, getMetrics, getPlayers])
        Note over App: UI 响应式自动刷新
    end

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ④ 玩家管理（PlayersView）═══

    U->>App: 进入「玩家管理」页 → 看到在线玩家表
    Note over App: players 来自轮询的 rest_get_players

    U->>App: 点击玩家行「踢人」
    App->>App: ConfirmDialog 弹窗「确认踢出 玩家昵称?」
    U->>App: 确认
    App->>SS: kickPlayer(userid)
    SS->>RP: rest_kick_player(server_path, userid)
    RP->>RP: 读 ini → AdminPassword
    RP->>REST: POST /v1/api/kick {"userid":"steam_xxx"}
    REST-->>RP: 200 OK
    RP-->>SS: ()
    Note over App: toast 成功 → 下次轮询玩家列表刷新

    U->>App: 输入广播消息 → 点击「发送」
    App->>SS: announce(message)
    SS->>RP: rest_announce(server_path, message)
    RP->>REST: POST /v1/api/announce {"message":"..."}
    REST-->>RP: 200 OK
    Note over App: toast「广播已发送」

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ⑤ 优雅关服 ═══

    U->>App: 仪表盘点击「优雅关服」
    App->>App: ConfirmDialog 弹窗「确认关闭服务器? 将在 30 秒后关闭」
    U->>App: 确认
    App->>SS: gracefulShutdown(30, "服务器即将关闭")
    SS->>RP: rest_shutdown(server_path, 30, message)
    RP->>REST: POST /v1/api/shutdown {"waittime":30, "message":"..."}
    REST-->>RP: 200 OK
    RP-->>SS: ()
    Note over App: UI 显示「服务器正在关闭... (30s)」

    Note over SS: REST /shutdown 是异步的 — 服务器倒计时后自行退出

    SRV->>SS: server-status-change {running: false}
    Note over SS: stdout 线程检测到进程退出 → emit 事件
    SS->>SS: stopPolling()
    App->>UIS: setMode('wizard')
    Note over App: 切回向导模式

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ⑤b 优雅关服失败 → 兜底 force kill ═══

    alt REST 不可用 (catch)
        App->>SS: forceStop()
        SS->>SRV: stop_server()
        SRV->>SRV: RCON Shutdown 尝试 (P0 未连 RCON, 跳过)
        SRV->>SRV: sleep(3s) → child.kill()
        SRV-->>SS: ServerStatus {running: false}
        SS->>SS: stopPolling()
        App->>UIS: setMode('wizard')
    end

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ⑥ 配置真实读写（ConfigView）═══

    U->>App: 进入「配置」页
    App->>SetS: computeConfigPath(server_path)
    SetS-->>App: "{path}/Pal/Saved/Config/WindowsServer/PalWorldSettings.ini"
    App->>App: configStore.load(configPath)
    Note over App: configStore.read_config → 返回 HashMap → 渲染分组配置项

    U->>App: 修改配置项（如 ServerPlayerMaxNum 16→32）
    App->>App: configStore.update(key, value) → dirty 标记

    U->>App: 点击「保存配置」
    alt 服务器运行中
        App->>App: 弹停服警告「运行中改配置需重启生效」
        U->>App: 选择「停服→改→重启」或「仅保存」
    end
    App->>App: configStore.save() → api.config.write(path, config)
    Note over App: Rust 侧自动备份旧配置 → 写入新配置

    Note over App,REST: ═══ ⑦ 网络检测 + 异地联机引导（NetworkView）═══

    U->>App: 进入「网络」页
    App->>App: networkStore.checkAll()
    Note over App: firewall.check → 3 张 PortCard 显示放行态
    Note over App: radmin.check → Radmin 状态卡显示虚拟 IP

    U->>App: 点击 PortCard「一键放行」(UDP 8211 未放行)
    App->>App: networkStore.addFirewallRules()
    App->>App: networkStore.checkFirewall() → 刷新状态徽标

    U->>App: 点击「一键复制连法」
    App->>App: clipboard.writeText("朋友连我帕鲁服：①装 Radmin VPN...")
    Note over App: toast「连法已复制到剪贴板」
